                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "thérianthropes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4700f29-14af-3dd7-8140-73727e276a2b",
                        "entry_id": "2fa01670-a769-39cd-959c-39282f45c723",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Être humain capable de se transformer en un autre animal et vice versa, de façon complète ou partielle, par exemple un loup-garou."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fantastique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45d97b9a-060b-4fa3-9fc6-4bc8ce58b148",
                                "sense_id": "c4700f29-14af-3dd7-8140-73727e276a2b",
                                "text": "« Les principales composantes d’une culture artistique hautement avancée, incluant de l’art figuratif, des scènes narratives et des thérianthropes, étaient présentes il y 44’000 ans » dans cette région d’Asie, souligne Maxime Aubert, qui ajoute: « selon une idée reçue, l’art rupestre est apparu en Europe, et consistait en des représentations symboliques abstraites »."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb6e975d-d4d1-31f8-a68d-f7b35f70d3d3",
                        "entry_id": "2fa01670-a769-39cd-959c-39282f45c723",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Créatures hybrides présentant de manière permanente des caractères humains et animaux, telles les sirènes ou les centaures."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fantastique"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5f207e53-c88f-35d8-8aaf-e7d2105069b2",
                        "entry_id": "2fa01670-a769-39cd-959c-39282f45c723",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne s’identifiant de manière partielle à un animal, psychologiquement ou spirituellement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c02f5b8d-729b-49be-9289-a6bc259a7d5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "2fa01670-a769-39cd-959c-39282f45c723",
                        "target_lang_word": "Therianthrop",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1a9ed54-3dc1-47f8-9481-30bb01b6694d",
                        "source_entry_id": "2fa01670-a769-39cd-959c-39282f45c723",
                        "target_lang_word": "therianthrope",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "therianthrope",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55cddb14-6cec-329f-a2ca-169271a42fe8",
                                        "entry_id": "e59a9a8b-79cc-3f9b-a0de-27bb8a11a12c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any mythical being which is part human, part animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b408d974-6732-4482-9f51-163600ea3e2c",
                                                "sense_id": "55cddb14-6cec-329f-a2ca-169271a42fe8",
                                                "text": "Among the depictions are a black rhinoceros, the body of an antelope covered by a red line, two white animals with black stripes that may be zebras, and a therianthrope. The therianthrope (Figure 9.11) appears to have a feline body with human hind legs that may have been added after the original legs had faded somewhat (Wendt 1974:27)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99b7e840-5bb1-49e9-a2a6-79f26ab8f355",
                                                "sense_id": "55cddb14-6cec-329f-a2ca-169271a42fe8",
                                                "text": "One appears to have a large beak while another has an appendage resembling a tail. In the language of archaeology, these are therianthropes, or characters that embody a mix of human and animal characteristics. […] The otherworldly nature of the therianthropes also raises the possibility that they are mythical beings, or manifestations of “animal spirit helpers” that are common in shamanic beliefs, according to the study."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70df8b48-abcb-34c6-952f-ee52b062b887",
                                        "entry_id": "e59a9a8b-79cc-3f9b-a0de-27bb8a11a12c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone with an intense spiritual or psychological identification as a non-human animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84f634ed-df3f-43fa-934d-f99c073a4329",
                                                "sense_id": "70df8b48-abcb-34c6-952f-ee52b062b887",
                                                "text": "Identifying as a therianthrope, Alex felt a deep, instinctive connection to wolves that shaped their sense of self and community."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44a0a1a5-f438-49df-a73c-05bf92fc20a4",
                                                "sense_id": "70df8b48-abcb-34c6-952f-ee52b062b887",
                                                "text": "Another is that I myself identify as Otherkin—a wolf therianthrope, to be exact—and I find this particular subculture to be absolutely fascinating."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
